OL,3,ATwo dead in Istanbul after heaviest
OL,4,Arainfall in 84 years, governor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have been told by Istanbul
OL,7,FGovernor Davut Gul to avoid leaving
OL,8,Ftheir homes unless absolutely
OL,9,Fnecessary.
